1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:02,755
Heh. We never got to the bedroom.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,960
(Sheldon:)Because?

3
00:00:07,215 --> 00:00:08,255
[SCOFFS]

4
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:11,464
(Penny:)Okay. All right. You know what?
I'll tell you what happened.

5
00:00:12,637 --> 00:00:14,677
Ah. We were young.

6
00:00:14,847 --> 00:00:18,057
(Penny:)We were very much in love,
but we could only communicate...

7
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:21,816
(Penny:)...through a time-traveling mailbox
at my lake house.

8
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:29,862
(Sheldon:)It's not enough that you made me watch
that movie, but now you mock me with it?

9
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:37,869
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, I have a question
about dating and relationships.

10
00:00:43,501 --> 00:00:46,041
(Raj:)You told me
you were gonna have the talk with him.

11
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:50,298
(Howard:)I've been waiting for someone
to have the talk with me.

12
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:54,555
(Sheldon:)More to the point, it's about finding a way
to keep Leonard and Stephanie together.

13
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:57,181
- Oh, I don't think you can.
- Why not?

14
00:00:57,348 --> 00:01:00,518
(Howard:)Look at Leonard's record.
Twenty-seven days with Joyce Kim.

